+
+The companion lives in the frame-wide overlay rather than a session factory, so switching history preserves the same SVG and animation clock without another center-to-corner flight.
+
+Bloop builds suppress slash suggestion menus for both typed triggers and the programmatic launcher. Slash characters remain in the draft, and `@` file/session suggestions remain available. The Bloop composer hint no longer advertises slash commands.
+
+## Bloop desktop workflow
+
+Bloop shows actual tool stages and lifecycle outcomes, retains the latest successful article, and never invents percentages. The companion varies its continuously animated poses with running, waiting and failure states. The composer omits usage details. In an active conversation, a 132px header reserves space for the 44%-scale docked companion so scrolling messages never pass underneath it. Attached images expose article, style-reference and text-extraction roles plus replacement targets; both keyboard and button submission wait for native intent persistence. Each article still admits at most six images, each at most 5 MB.
