+## Bloop desktop workflow
+
+BloopArticleCard and BloopModelSettings accept a validated BloopClient and caller-owned localized labels. They do not grant capabilities to generated HTML. Article actions address immutable revisions; cancellation is distinct from save success. Stored credentials return only presence flags, and typed key drafts clear after saving. createBloopClient resolves the optional trusted preload extension at registration time and validates every consumed response field.
