 -----
 
 <a id="model-experience"></a>
+## Single-directory desktop builds
+
+A build with `DSH_CLIENT_WORKSPACE_PATH` set to an absolute directory starts a blank conversation in that directory and keeps New Session in the same directory. The sidebar presents flat conversation history without workspace creation, selection, or grouping controls; global plugin panels remain available through Tools. Existing workspace records and conversation logs are retained. This is a public build-time value, not a model instruction or a filesystem permission setting. Builds without the value retain the standard workspace interface.
+
 ## Model Experience
 
 None, as the package is a browser-side UI plugin layer that registers nothing model-facing.
